                                <tls:srcline title="勅修百丈清規" target="#T48n2025_CBETA_005-1143a0401.s23" pos="4">一切善惡都莫思量。</tls:srcline>
                                <tls:line title="Shinjin mei Shōdō ka Jūgyō zu Zazen gi, Zen no goroku, vol. 16" transl-id="T48n2025-zh-0059f1b1" src="Kajitani Sōnin et al.">一切善悪、都莫思量。</tls:line>
